  "interpretation": [
    "Addresses name sites; increasing an address does not increase the number of active qubits.",
    "tableau_bytes and address_bytes are logical payload counters, not process RAM; metadata, copies and temporary query memory are excluded.",
    "Timing values are single in-process host samples, with no device or speedup inference; other validation ran in the same environment.",
    "The GHZ1000 probe includes the X product on all 1000 sites to check coherence as well as Z correlation.",
    "The finite Clifford algebra is exact up to global phase; independent floating-point oracle comparisons use tolerance 1e-10.",
    "This finite collection of tests is evidence for the supported contracts, not a proof of correctness for every possible program.",
    "The code was first checked on e06ba2a, then rebased and the affected suites rebuilt and rerun against integrated main 7fd001c.",
    "Linux local checks are recorded here. Windows/Linux GitHub Actions results are recorded by their separate run, not inferred here."
  ],
